tests/golden/permissive/fixedbugs-445-the-control-arm-refuses-a-header-no-windows-file-holds.hero:11:8: error[unwritable_name]: this header's name holds `"`, which no file's name on Windows can hold, so `a\"b.h` does not name one file on every machine: write the name without it, as `extern "math.h"`
